he docks beh\u001b[38Gv\u001b[41Gex\u001b[44Gc\u001b[46Gly as today (first com\u001b[69G,\u001b[71Gfi\u001b[74Gst served), so the exi\u001b[97Gting\u001b[102Gdock tests and\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gpinned hashes don't move. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDocks::Park\u001b[39m skips\u001b[49Gboth hooks.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mProof:\u001b[12G\u001b[22ma dock\u001b[19Gtest that refuses one vehicle\u001b[49Gwi\u001b[54Gits own\u001b[62Greason\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gmoves\u001b[79Ga\u001b[81Glater\u001b[87Garrival\u001b[95Gup\u001b[98Gthe\u001b[102Gqueue.\u001b[109GThen\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdocs (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocks.md\u001b[39m), \u001b[23Ghe roadmap row moved to history, and the gate.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNot doing:\u001b[22m checking a queued\u001b[34Gvehicle again when the game's\u001b[64Gstate\u001b[70Gchanges\u001b[78Gafter\u001b[84Gits\u001b[88Grequest,\u001b[97Gand\u001b[101Gletting\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113Ggame\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gchoose which berth a vehicle\u001b[34Gg\u001b[36Gts. L04 \u001b[45Gsks for\u001b[53Gneither. A\u001b[64Gbooking \u001b[73Gcc\u001b[76Gpted before\u001b[88Ga policy\u001b[97Gchang\u001b[103G keeps its terms,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Band Manifest's \u001b[21Gank can encode \u001b[37Ghat.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mModel:\u001b[10G\u001b[22mOpus\u001b[15Gat\u001b[18Ghigh\u001b[23Geffort\u001b[30Gfor\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38Ghook\u001b[43Gdesign\u001b[50Gand\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mServe\u001b[64G\u001b[39mchange.\u001b[72GThe\u001b[76Granking\u001b[84Gtouches\u001b[92Gdeterminism\u001b[104Gand\u001b[108Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bquiet-step logic, and a cheaper model is likelier to get that wrong\u001b[76Gdocs and the history entry c\u001b[106G go to\u001b[113GSonnet.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BGo\u001b[6Gahead\u001b[12Gwith\u001b[17Gthis?\u001b[23GAlso\u001b[28Gstill\u001b[34Gwaiti