tate; whatever\u001b[71Ga\u001b[73Grule\u001b[78Greads\u001b[84Gis\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Ggame's\u001b[98Gown\u001b[102Gsaved\u001b[108Gcomponents.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWi\u001b[9G \u001b[11Go\u001b[13Grules set\u001b[22m, the docks beh\u001b[38Gv\u001b[41Gex\u001b[44Gc\u001b[46Gly as today (first com\u001b[69G,\u001b[71Gfi\u001b[74Gst served), so the exi\u001b[97Gting\u001b[102Gdock tests and\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gpinned hashes don't move. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDocks::Park\u001b[39m skips\u001b[49Gboth hooks.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mProof:\u001b[12G\u001b[22ma dock\u001b[19Gtest that refuses one vehicle\u001b[49Gwi\u001b[54Gits own\u001b[62Greason\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gmoves\u001b[79Ga\u001b[81Glater\u001b[87Garrival\u001b[95Gup\u001b[98Gthe\u001b[102Gqueue.\u001b[109GThen\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdocs (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocks.md\u001b[39m), \u001b[23Ghe roadmap row moved to history, and the gate.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNot doing:\u001b[22m checking a queued\u001b[34Gvehicle again when the game's\u001b[64Gstate\u001b[70Gchanges\u001b[78Gafter\u001b[84Gits\u001b[88Grequest,\u001b[97Gand\u001b[101Gletting\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113Ggame\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gchoose which berth a vehicle\u001b[34Gg\u001b[36Gts. L04 \u001b[45Gsks for\u001b[53Gneither. A\u001b[64Gbooking \u001b[73Gcc\u001b[76Gpted before\u001b[88Ga policy\u001b[97Gchang\u001b[103G keeps its terms,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Band Manifest's \u001b[21Gank can encode \u001b[37Ghat.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B   \u001b[9G          \u001b[20G    \u001b[25G   \u001b[29G      \u001b[36G     \u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
