[0.061, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242md once in it at a step set by its index, with quiet steps put off to the next tick. Nothing saved befo\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mre changes, and no pinned hash moved ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mAI\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](../ai.md#behaviour-trees)). | Met: the `ai` suite's reactiv\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242me sequence stops work once its condition fails, halting it; its reactive selector breaks an errand off\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m to flee and goes back to it; a parallel succeeds on one of two and halts the other, needs every child\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m with no count, fails at once on a failure it cannot make up, and refuses a count past its children an\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242md a 33rd child; a trip of two subtrees runs as seven nodes and refuses a tree not yet defined; the com\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mmand assigns, replaces with a halt, refuses three ways, takes a tree away keeping the blackboard, and \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mthe helm halts and restarts the tree, the blackboard saved; and three entities on a six-step interval \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mare each ticked once in six steps, on different steps, a world fast-forwarded through 600 steps saving\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m the same bytes as one stepped. |                                                                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 222 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                     