[0.051, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/jettison.lane-c/docs/scripts.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m1\u001b[14G\u001b[22mline,\u001b[20Gremoved\u001b[28G\u001b[1m1\u001b[30G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 222 \u001b[22m ### A scrip\u001b[24G's \u001b[28Gwn reasons\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 223 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4\u001b[12G\u001b[22mA command a game lets \u001b[35Gcripts\u001b[42Gsend\u001b[47Gmay\u001b[51Gsay\u001b[55Gwhy,\u001b[60Gas\u001b[63Ga\u001b[65G`Sim::Reason`\u001b[79Gfield\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 225 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([reasons](simulation.md#reasons)): a trade refused, a berth turned down. The script gives the        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 225 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\u001b[48;2;4;71;0mevents and \u001b[48;2;2;40;0mreasons\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](simulation.md#\u001b[48;2;4;71;0mevents-and-\u001b[48;2;2;40;0mreasons)): a trade refused, a berth turned down. The sc\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mript gives the                                                                                        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 226 \u001b[22m reason's name and its arguments, and the host makes the key `reason.script.<script>.<name>`, in\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 227 \u001b[22m every reason the command holds, wherever it nests, as it writes the sender. A script therefore words\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m8\u001b[12G\u001b[22monly it\u001b[21Gown reasons,\u001b[34Gnever an engine module's or another script's. A name i\u001b[89G lower-case letters,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/jettison.lane-c' && clang-format -i 'source/engine/script/src/ScriptHost.cpp' \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m'source/engine/script/include/jettison/script/ScriptHost.h' 'source/engine/app/src/Application.cpp' \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m'source/engine/script/te\u001b[31Gts/ScriptTests.\u001b[47Gpp' 'source/engine/\u001b[72G/tests/BindingsTest\u001b[92G.cpp' 'so…\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
