[0.102, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 222 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m###\u001b[16GA\u001b[18Gscript's\u001b[27Gown\u001b[31Greasons\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 223 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4\u001b[12G\u001b[22mA command a game lets \u001b[35Gcripts\u001b[42Gsend\u001b[47Gmay\u001b[51Gsay\u001b[55Gwhy,\u001b[60Gas\u001b[63Ga\u001b[65G`Sim::Reason`\u001b[79Gfield\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 225 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([reasons](simulation.md#reasons)): a trade refused, a berth turned down. The script gives the        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 225 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\u001b[48;2;4;71;0mevents and \u001b[48;2;2;40;0mreasons\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](simulation.md#\u001b[48;2;4;71;0mevents-and-\u001b[48;2;2;40;0mreasons)): a trade refused, a berth turned down. The sc\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mript gives the                                                                                        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 226 \u001b[22m reason's name and its arguments, and the host makes the key `reason.script.<script>.<name>`, in\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 227 \u001b[22m every reason the command holds, wherever it nests, as it writes the sender. A script therefore words\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m8\u001b[12G\u001b[22monly it\u001b[21Gown reasons,\u001b[34Gnever an engine module's or another script's. A name i\u001b[89G lower-case letters,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m6\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[25G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAll the checks pass. I'm\u001b[28Gcommitting\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gfirst\u001b[49GJ04\u001b[53Gcommit.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+20\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, committed \u001b[1mc0d01d1\u001b[22m, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThat's commit 1 of J04 (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mc0d01d1\u001b[39m). Before going on, I'm reviewing J05\u001b[72Gfrom\u001b[77Glane\u001b[82GB,\u001b[85Gstarting\u001b[94Gwith\u001b[99Gits\u001b[103Gsource\u001b[110Gchanges.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell\u001b[19Gcommands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[8B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
