[0.081, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 486 \u001b[22m   `Manifest::Policy::Choose`.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 487 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- A script called from a tree's task, as an input is from a consideration ([J04](roadmap.md#j04)).    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 487 \u001b[22m - Steering: no course round the inside of a platform, and no measurement yet for a lane busier than\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 488 \u001b[22m   a platform's traffic ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mJ08\u001b[39m](roadmap.md#j08)).\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 489 \u001b[22m - The way in to a berth, which steering flies for the docks ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mJ09\u001b[39m](roadmap.md#j09)).\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/jettison.lane-c/docs/ai.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 226 \u001b[22m applied at once ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116ma step\u001b[39m](simulation.md#a-step)), carrying the agent as their sender where they\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m227\u001b[12G\u001b[22mcarry one. A task may be defined with a halt (`Ai::TaskHalt`), called with its context when\u001b[104Git\u001b[107Gis\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m228\u001b[12G\u001b[22mleft\u001b[17Grunning,\u001b[26Gso\u001b[29Git\u001b[32Gcan\u001b[36Glet\u001b[40Ggo\u001b[43Gof\u001b[46Gwhat\u001b[51Git\u001b[54Gholds\u001b[60G(a\u001b[63Gberth\u001b[69Gasked\u001b[75Gfor);\u001b[81Gits\u001b[85Gmemory\u001b[92Gis\u001b[95Gdiscarded\u001b[105Gafter.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 229 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mA mod's script may answer a task, which the game defines in its trees ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mscripts\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](scripts.md#a-trees-ta\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242msk)).                                                                                                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m 230 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 231 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m**The\u001b[18Gblackboard.**\u001b[32G`Ai::Blackboard`\u001b[49Gis\u001b[52Gan\u001b[55Gentity's\u001b[64Gmemory\u001b[71Gthat\u001b[76Gits\u001b[80Gtasks\u001b[86Gshare,\u001b[93Gby\u001b[96Gkey:\u001b[101Gintegers\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 232 \u001b[22m and entitie\u001b[24G, saved with the world\u001b[47Gand kept when its tree starts\u001b[77Gagain \u001b[86Gis changed.\u001b[98GA\u001b[100Gtask\u001b[105Greads\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[11G\u001b[39m\u001b[1m1\u001b[17G\u001b[22m…\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m~/projects/jetti\u001b[23Gon.lane-c/docs/decisions.md\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[8B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
