[0.125, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 62 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- A script called from a behaviour tree's task, as an input is called from a consideration.            \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 62 \u001b[22m - A script reloaded when its module changes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m63 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m64 \u001b[22m **Why.** A tree's task is where an NPC's script would\u001b[65Gact,\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74Greload\u001b[81Gis\u001b[84Gwhat\u001b[89Ga\u001b[91Gmodder\u001b[98Gneeds\u001b[104Gto\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/jettison.lane-c/docs/roadmap.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line, removed \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m \u001b[31Gi\u001b[34Gs\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 61 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[9G \u001b[22m - A script reloaded when it\u001b[39G \u001b[41Godule changes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m63 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 64 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m**Why.** A tree's task is where an NPC's script would act, and reload is what a modder needs to        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 65 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwrite scripts quickly.                                                                                 \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m64\u001b[10G+\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m**Why\u001b[17G**\u001b[20GReload\u001b[27Gis\u001b[30Gwhat\u001b[35Ga\u001b[37Gmodder\u001b[44Gneeds\u001b[50Gto\u001b[53Gwrite\u001b[59Gscripts\u001b[67Gquickly.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m65 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m66 \u001b[22m *\u001b[13GWhat\u001b[18Gexists.** WAMR's interprete\u001b[46G, bounded by fuel\u001b[64Gand b\u001b[71Ga wall-time\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m67 \u001b[22m [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mwatchdog\u001b[39m](glos\u001b[28Gry.md#watc\u001b[39Gdog) (`script/ScriptHos\u001b[63G.h`). A sc\u001b[74Gipt is granted\u001b[89G`log`, `store` and one\r\u001b[3C\u001b[2Bunn\u001b[11G\u001b[1m8\u001b[13G\u001b[22mshell commands…\r\u001b[78C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[8B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
