[0.052, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 63 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 64 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m**Why.** A tree's task is where an NPC's script would act, and reload is what a modder needs to        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 65 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwrite scripts quickly.                                                                                 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 64 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m**Why.** Reload is what a modder needs to write scripts quickly.                                       \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m5\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 66 \u001b[11G\u001b[22m**What\u001b[18Gexists.**\u001b[28GWAMR's\u001b[35Ginterpreter,\u001b[48Gbounded\u001b[56Gby\u001b[59Gfuel\u001b[64Gand\u001b[68Gby\u001b[71Ga\u001b[73Gwall-time\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 67 \u001b[22m [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mwatchdog\u001b[39m](glossary.md#watchdog)\u001b[44G(`script/ScriptHost.h`).\u001b[69GA\u001b[71Gscript\u001b[78Gis\u001b[81Ggranted\u001b[89G`log`,\u001b[96G`store`\u001b[104Gand\u001b[108Gone\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m8\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mEverything passes. I'm committing part 3.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+17\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, committed \u001b[1m6d645ac\u001b[22m, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mPart\u001b[8G3\u001b[10Gis\u001b[13Gcommitted,\u001b[24Gand\u001b[28Gsince\u001b[34GJ05\u001b[38Gchanged\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gfile\u001b[55Gsystem\u001b[62Gchange-stamp\u001b[75Gcode\u001b[80Gthat\u001b[85GPart\u001b[90G4\u001b[92Gdepends\u001b[100Gon,\u001b[104GI'm\u001b[108Grebasing\