[0.076, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe J06 pick will use a new Physics::SnapshotPicker in presentation, which casts rays against Jolt shapes at the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Binterpolated alpha, so it works without a physics world; Physics::Pick stays for picks the simulation must record.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNext I'm reading the code that builds Jolt shapes from definitions.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[1m3\u001b[14G\u001b[22ms, ran \u001b[1m7\u001b[22m she\u001b[27Gl co\u001b[32Gmands \r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mWill there be a way to skip picking on static objects?\u001b[39m                                                                \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm adding an option to the picker that\u001b[43Gexcludes\u001b[52Gstatic\u001b[59Gbodies,\u001b[67Gwith\u001b[72Ga\u001b[74Gmatching\u001b[83Gflag\u001b[88Gon\u001b[91GPickSpace\u001b[101Gso\u001b[104Gclick\u001b[110Gand\u001b[114Ghover\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcan\u001b[7Gbe\u001b[10Gset\u001b[14Gseparately,\u001b[26Gand\u001b[30Gstatic\u001b[37Gbodies\u001b[44Gstay\u001b[49Gincluded\u001b[58Gby\u001b[61Gdefault.\u001b[70GI'm\u001b[74Gchecking\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87Grest\u001b[92Gof\u001b[95GBody\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104GPickSpace\u001b[114Gfirst.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[2Bcd '/home/iv\u001b[25G/projects/jettison.lane-c'\u001b[52G&&\u001b[55G./scr…\r\u001b[45C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mc\u001b[52G./scripts/ci.sh\u001b[68G--werror --asan\u001b[84G--log build/gate.log (3m 33s · 14 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Blines)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[42C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;15