[0.175, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mrvation put off each time its vehicle comes 1 m nearer (`kProgress`), lapsing after the layout's `rese\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mrvationSeconds`, now 60 by default, of no progress. The dock suite's pin moved for the new flight; the\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m steering suite's for the saved field alone ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdocks\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](../docks.md#the-way-in)). | Met: from all round H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mighport, 2 and 4 km out, still or at 150 m/s across, all 48 land touching nothing, each 12 to 26 s soo\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mner than the stopgap, 2,818 s against 3,945 in all (`Docks benchmark`, Release); the 24 at 2 km land w\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mithin 80 s, where the stopgap took up to 92; from 10 km Highport's shuttle is in its corridor in 87 s \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mand clamped 30 s later, against 117 and 24; two side by side land on the next pads, each down its own \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcorridor, touching nothing; and a skiff flown in for far longer than a two-second reservation keeps it\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m, coming nearer, and lands. |                                                                         \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m2\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m \u001b[14G          \u001b[25G \u001b[27G     \u001b[33G \u001b[35G     \u001b[41G  \u001b[44G \u001b[46G         \u001b[56G   \u001b[60G      \u001b[67G  \u001b[70G      \u001b[77G    \u00