[0.091, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/jettison.lane-b/docs/physics.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m1\u001b[14G\u001b[22mline,\u001b[20Gremoved\u001b[28G\u001b[1m1\u001b[30G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 183 \u001b[22m `CastRay` find\u001b[27G the first body along a ray.\u001b[56G`CastShape`\u001b[68Gfinds\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gfirst\u001b[84Gbody\u001b[89Ga\u001b[91Gdefined\u001b[99Gshape\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 184 \u001b[12G\u001b[22mmeets, sw\u001b[22Gpt along a direction:\u001b[44Gwhether\u001b[52Ga\u001b[54Gvehicle\u001b[62Gfits\u001b[67Gthrough\u001b[75Ga\u001b[77Ggap,\u001b[82Gor\u001b[85Ghow\u001b[89Gfar\u001b[93Git\u001b[96Gcan\u001b[100Ggo.\u001b[104GBoth\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5\u001b[12G\u001b[22mse\u001b[15Grch every local frame of one frame,\u001b[51Gand both return a `Ca\u001b[73GtHit` (en\u001b[83Gity, distance, point,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 186 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mnormal) or nothing. `CastOptions` leaves out the caster's own body (`ignore`) and, unless             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 186 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mnormal) or nothing\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m; of two hits as near, the lower entity's, whichever local frame is searched first\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m. \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`CastOptions` leaves out the caster's own body (`ignore`) and, unless                                 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 187 \u001b[22m asked for, sensors. Casts read the world as the last step left it, and are for the simulation's\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 188 \u001b[22m systems to call. Steering sweeps a vehicle's shape with `CastShape` ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mAI\u001b[39m](ai.md)).\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mReading \u001b[1m1\u001b[13G\u001b[22mfile,\u001b[19Grunning\u001b[27G\u001b[1m1\u001b[29G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[35Gcommand…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/jettison.lane-b' && clang-format -i 'source/engine/ai/src/BehaviourTree.cpp' \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m'source/engine/ai/include/jettison/ai/BehaviourTree.h' 'source/engine/ai/src/Courses.cpp' \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m'sourc\u001b[13G/engine/ai/tests/BehaviourTreeTests.cpp' 'source/engine/ai/tests/CoursesTests.cpp' 'source/engine/s…\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
