't proving\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Banything yet. Checking what the crash handler creates at install.\u001b[K\r\u001b[44C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mought for 3s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
