[0.071, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 95 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mnothing of it, the copy, a string in it or a reference: each is refused as the script compiles         \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m6\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m(th\u001b[15G suite's `kept.rs`). The component           \u001b[61G       \u001b[69G    \u001b[74G   \u001b[78G        \u001b[87G  \u001b[90G    \u001b[95G    \u001b[100G   \u001b[104G    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 97 \u001b[22m is one Reflect marks `Script` and the world shows in its snapshots\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 98 \u001b[22m (`Sim::SimWorld::ShowInSnapshots`), or the grant does not load. The game gives the host the\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[11G\u001b[22msnapshot once,\u001b[26G`ScriptHost::Re\u001b[42GdFrom`, as the shell g\u001b[65Gves its stepper's\u001b[83Gcurrent\u001b[91Gone,\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gone\u001b[104Gafter\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mEverything is clean and\u001b[27Gall\u001b[31G33\u001b[34Gsuites\u001b[41Gpass.\u001b[47GCommitting\u001b[58Ground\u001b[64G3's\u001b[68Gfixes\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Grunning\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Ggate.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+21\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, committed \u001b[1m4ba5121\u001b[22m, searched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, ran \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe gate passed (249 s). Writing the round 3 reply and starting round 4.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+48\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b