[0.046, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 97 \u001b[22m is one Reflect marks `Script` and the world shows in its snapshots\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 98 \u001b[22m (`Sim::SimWorld::ShowInSnapshots`), or the grant does not load. The game gives the host the\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[11G\u001b[22msnapshot once,\u001b[26G`ScriptHost::Re\u001b[42GdFrom`, as the shell g\u001b[65Gves its stepper's\u001b[83Gcurrent\u001b[91Gone,\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gone\u001b[104Gafter\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mEverything is clean and\u001b[27Gall\u001b[31G33\u001b[34Gsuites\u001b[41Gpass.\u001b[47GCommitting\u001b[58Ground\u001b[64G3's\u001b[68Gfixes\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Grunning\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Ggate.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+21\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, committed \u001b[1m4ba5121\u001b[22m, searched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, ran \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe gate passed (249 s). Writing the round 3 reply and starting round 4.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+48\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRound 4 is running in the background. I'll pick up\u001b[54Gits\u001b[58Gfindings\u001b[67Gwhen\u001b[72Git\u001b[75Gfinishes.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;107;128m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBackground\u001b[14Gcomma\u001b[20Gd\u001b[22G\"Cross-review round 4\" fa\u001b[48Gled with ex\u001b[60Gt code\u001b[67G1\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mReading \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file…\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[8B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to 