[0.085, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 159 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B 160 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m**Commands\u001b[23Gand\u001b[27Gevents.**\u001b[37G`Ai::SetDestination`\u001b[58Ggives\u001b[64Ga\u001b[66Gvehicle\u001b[74Ga\u001b[76Gdestination,\u001b[89Gfrom\u001b[94Gits\u001b[98Gfirst\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/j\u001b[23Gttison.lane-b/docs/scripts.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[11G\u001b[22m|\u001b[13G(answering\u001b[24Ginputs)\u001b[32G|\u001b[34G`input`\u001b[42G|\u001b[44GAsk\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Ggame\u001b[57Gfor\u001b[61Gone\u001b[65Gof\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Goption's\u001b[81Gother\u001b[87Ginputs\u001b[94G|\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 85 \u001b[22m The `input` import is allowed when the definition lists inputs. A module that imports anything\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 86 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mnot granted, from any module, is refused as it loads, naming the import.                               \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m6\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mn\u001b[13Gt granted, from \u001b[31Gy module, is refused as it loads, naming the import.\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m So is one that would run\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m7\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcode as it is \u001b[26Gnstantiated, before any call's\u001b[57Gfuel and time \u001b[72Gimit: one w\u001b[84Gt\u001b[87Ga start function,\u001b[105Gor\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 88 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mexporting `_initialize`, `__post_instantiate` or `__wasm_call_ctors`, which WAMR calls then.           \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m89\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m0\u001b[1