[0.167, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/jettison.lane-b/docs/scripts.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m3\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines,\u001b[21Gremoved\u001b[29G\u001b[1m1\u001b[31G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 83 \u001b[22m | (answering inputs) | `input` | Ask the game\u001b[57Gfor\u001b[61Gone\u001b[65Gof\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Goption's\u001b[81Gother\u001b[87Ginputs\u001b[94G|\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 84 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5\u001b[11G\u001b[22mThe `input` impor\u001b[29G is allowed when the definiti\u001b[59Gn\u001b[61Glists inputs. A module that imports\u001b[97Ganything\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 86 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mnot granted, from any module, is refused as it loads, naming the import.                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 86 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mnot granted, from any module, is refused as it loads, naming the import.\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m So is one that would run\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 87 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcode as it is instantiated, before any call's fuel and time limit: one with a start function, or       \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m8\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mexporti\u001b[19Gg `_initialize`, `__post_instanti\u001b[53Gte` or `__wasm_call_ctors`, which WAMR calls then.     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 89 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 90 \u001b[22m ### Reading the world\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m91\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mChecks are clean. Committing\u001b[32Ground\u001b[38G4's\u001b[42Gfixes\u001b[48Gand\