[0.035, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 85 \u001b[22m The `input` import is allowed when the definition lists inputs. A module that imports anything\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 86 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mnot granted, from any module, is refused as it loads, naming the import.                               \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m6\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mnot gra\u001b[19Gted, from any module, is refused \u001b[53Gs it loads, naming the import.\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m So is one that would run\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 87 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcode as it is instantiated, before any call's fuel and time limit: one with a start function, or       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 88 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mexporting `_initialize`, `__post_instantiate` or `__wasm_call_ctors`, which WAMR calls then.           \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m89\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B 90 \u001b[11G\u001b[22m###\u001b[15GReading\u001b[23Gthe\u001b[27Gworld\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 91 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mChecks are clean. Committing round 4's fixes and running the gate.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMade \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+21\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m, committed \u001b[1m0b9779d\u001b[22m, ran \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mG\u001b[5Gte passed (251 s). Writing the round 4 reply and\u001b[54Glau\u001b[58Gching\u001b[64Ground\u001b[70G5, the last.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mMaking \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m scratchpad edit \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+40\u001b[39m, listing \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, running